BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-lxncs8@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Claudio Kirac\, Morag Myerscough & Naina Sen
DESCRIPTION:Come gather under the bright bold BEACON of belonging for an il
 luminating conversation and rare insight into the creative practice from c
 ross-disciplinary artist Claudio Kirac\, Kaleidoscope Skies\, Internationa
 l acclaimed UK artist and designer\, Morag Myerscough\, BEACON and world a
 cclaimed filmmaker and video artist Naina Sen\, Shundori. This artist talk
  will be hosted by Kate Baggerson\, Executive Director\, Co-Founder and Ar
 tistic Director of Everybody NOW! - creators of participatory arts experie
 nces that generate joy. Everybody NOW! are nationally recognised for their
  ability to create highly professional and innovative arts projects\, with
  high-impact community benefits. For anyone interested in large-scale comm
 unity arts projects\, storytelling\, placemaking and cross-cultural collab
 orations\, creative process and the journey to bring joy\, hope and connec
 tion. This will be an insightful and inspiring experience - join us!
LOCATION:HOTA Lake Precinct
URL:https://bleachfestival.com.au/events/bleach-26-artist-talk
END:VEVENT
