UID:goldcoast-11ex8dq@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T170000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T190000
SUMMARY:Blanc de Blanc Encore
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Blanc de Blanc Encore brings a sparkling night of bold come
 dy\, cabaret\, and seductive spectacle to Brisbane. Expect high-energy per
 formances\, playful chaos\, and a riotous atmosphere that doesn’t hold b
 ack. 🍾 SPECIAL OCCASION? Enjoy premium experiences with special package
 s - book now here 🍾 Highlights 🍾 Sip champagne in a playful\, adults
 -only atmosphere 🎭 Enjoy cheeky comedy\, cabaret\, burlesque\, and live
  entertainment 🤸‍♀️ Marvel at high-energy performances from acrob
 ats\, dancers\, and aerialists 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purc
 hase a gift card here General Info 📅 Dates and times: select your date 
 & time directly in the ticket selector ⏳ Duration: 115 minutes\, includi
 ng a short interval 📍 Location: The West End Electric 👤 Age requirem
 ent: 18+ with valid ID ♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessib
 le ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience here Tickets 🍾 Moët 
 Champagne Table for Two: Private reserved table for two\, with a bottle of
  Moët champagne and premium raised front-on view of stage (ticketed per t
 able\, not per person) 🥂 Ringside VIP: Reserved seating with a glass of
  sparkling\, up close to the performers 🎫 Platform: Raised\, front-on v
 iew\, unallocated seats 🎫 Premium Platform: Raised\, front-on view\, un
 allocated seats 💺 Premium: Comfortable seating behind Ringside VIP\, un
 allocated seats 🎫 Balcony: Only available when a show is almost at full
  capacity! Bird’s-eye view\, unallocated seats (stairs only) 🎫 Classi
 c: Behind Premium seating\, unallocated seats 🎫 Cheap Seats: Entry-leve
 l indulgence\, unallocated seats 🎫 Tightarse Wednesday: Discounted tick
 ets for Wednesday sessions\, access all sections at one price\, unallocate
 d seats Description Blanc de Blanc Encore invites you into a five-star\, c
 hampagne-soaked extravaganza of world-class circus\, acrobatics\, cheeky h
 umour\, and vintage glamour — all within Brisbane's award-winning new ve
 nue\, The West End Electric. Arrive early to soak up the velvet-draped opu
 lence that nods to the allure of London's West End Theatre District. Compl
 ete with hand-crafted cocktails\, mouth-watering bar bites and of course -
  Champagne!
LOCATION:Fever Gold Coast\, Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/527495
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-ez1o6o@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T193000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T213000
SUMMARY:Brisbane's True Crime Tour
DESCRIPTION:Highlights 🌃 Peel back the glamour of modern Brisbane to rev
 eal a brutal and bloody history 🕵️‍♂️ Retrace the steps of the 
 city’s most infamous brawlers\, fraudsters\, and outlaws 🚶‍♂️ E
 xplore historic buildings and hidden alleyways where dark secrets still li
 nger 😱 Hear jaw-dropping true stories of love triangles gone wrong and 
 lawless underworlds General Info 📅 Date & Time: choose date and time di
 rectly in ticket selector 📍 Location: Meets at the front entrance of th
 e Brisbane City Hall in King George Square 👤 Age: Recommended for matur
 e audiences ⏳ Duration: approx. 1.5 hours ❓ Weather Policy: Tours run 
 in most conditions. Dark Stories will contact you via SMS/Email at least 9
 0 minutes before start time if weather impacts the tour. Description Don
 ’t let the bright lights of "Bris-Vegas" fool you. Beneath the bustling 
 city streets lies a dark past that the city tried to forget. Join us for a
  leisurely guided walking tour that transports you back to a seemingly law
 less world of crime and intrigue. From notorious historical figures to the
  criminal underbelly that once plagued the city\, this investigation uncov
 ers the secrets hiding behind every historic facade. Forget what you think
  you know about Brisbane and prepare for a trip down a memory lane you nev
 er knew existed. Get your tickets for Brisbane’s True Crime Tour and tak
 e a walk on the dark side!
LOCATION:Fever Gold Coast\, Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/641245
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-1ye94dh@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T200000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T220000
SUMMARY:Late Night Vice - Brisbane
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Step into a world of mischief\, glamour\, and late-night in
 dulgence. Where your fantasies take centre stage. Late Night Vice is bold 
 ‘after-hours’ theatre on a wicked scale\, where the lights are low\, t
 he energy is intoxicating\, and absolutely anything can happen. The unoffi
 cial after party of this year's Brisbane Festival. 🚨 RETURNING TO BRISB
 ANE! Don't miss out on Brisbane's most notorious night out! 🚨 Highlight
 s 📱 Enter a no-phones world of late-night revelry and theatrical chaos 
 ✨ Expect seductive spectacle\, subversive performance\, and an atmospher
 e so thick with vice you could bottle it 🍸 Indulge in cocktails\, cabar
 et\, and unforgettable spectacle 🤵 Dress to impress in black tie or all
  black—bonus points for jewels and bold bling! 🎁 Gift memories to som
 eone special! Purchase a gift card here General Info 📅 Dates and times:
  select your date & time directly in the ticket selector ⏳ Duration: 2 h
 ours 📍 Venue: The West End Electric 👤 Age requirement: 18+ with vali
 d ID ♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible ❓ Please cons
 ult the FAQs of this experience here Description Slink into Brisbane’s g
 limmering wild side— Late Night Vice is a deliciously unhinged and wicke
 dly funny cocktail-drenched fever dream\, where cabaret collides with chao
 s. No phones. No cameras. Just bad behaviour\, whispered secrets\, and a r
 ogue’s gallery of theatrical renegades. Dress in black\, glitter like si
 n\, and vanish into a night that will linger long after the final curtain.
  Some things are better left unposted. Get your tickets for Late Night Vic
 e at The West End Electric in Brisbane! Seating Map
LOCATION:Fever Gold Coast\, Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/556285
END:VEVENT
