UID:goldcoast-paw9wr@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270312
SUMMARY:Springbrook and Tamborine Rainforest Tour Incl. Natural Bridge and 
 Glow Worm Cave
DESCRIPTION:📱 Smartphone tickets ⚡ Instant access to your tickets ⏳ 
 Duration: 8h 45m 👉 Experience available in English Embark on an epic ad
 venture from Brisbane\, diving into the heart of the Gondwana Rainforests!
  Our day trip takes you to the stunning Springbrook and Tamborine national
  parks\, where you'll wander through enchanting rainforests\, marvel at ca
 scading waterfalls\, and explore the magical Glow Worm caves. Don't miss t
 he breathtaking mountain vistas! While lunch isn't on us\, you'll love the
  chance to discover the local flavors and crafts at Gallery Walk. Enjoy an
  intimate experience with our small-group tour\, capped at 21 explorers\, 
 and soak up the rich knowledge shared by our friendly guide. Get your tick
 ets for Springbrook and Tamborine Rainforest Tour Incl Natural Bridge and 
 Glow Worm Cave! Highlights 🌲 Explore the majestic Gondwana Rainforests\
 , a World Heritage area\, with guided walks and stunning waterfalls. 🐛 
 Discover the magical world of glow worms in the specially constructed Ceda
 r Creek Glow Worm caves. 🎨 Immerse yourself in the eclectic arts and cr
 aft district - Gallery Walk\, with its unique finds and local cafes. What'
 s included? ✔️ Bottled water to keep you refreshed throughout the jour
 ney. ✔️ National Park fees for hassle-free access to breathtaking view
 s. ✔️ An experienced driver/guide to lead the way and enrich your expe
 rience. ✔️ Comfortable travel in an air-conditioned vehicle\, includin
 g a minivan for a more intimate exploration. Itinerary Tamborine Mountain 
 Natural Bridge - Admission included Tamborine Mountain Glow Worm Caves - A
 dmission included Curtis Falls - Admission included Canungra Additional In
 formation 🚆 Nearby public transportation options are available. ❌ Not
