 evel of physical fitness is required for travelers. 👥 This is a small-g
 roup tour with a maximum of 21 participants. ☔ The tour operates in all 
 weather conditions\; dressing appropriately is advised. 👟 Comfortable c
 losed-toe shoes are recommended. Why choose Fever? ✔️ Millions of user
 s book every month. ✔️ The best prices and availability at all times. 
