SUMMARY:ADALITA (GOLD COAST)
DESCRIPTION:Released in 2011\, Adalita’s self-titled debut marked the beg
 inning of her remarkable solo journey. Raw\, intimate\, and emotionally fe
 arless\, it struck a deep chord with listeners and remains one of the most
  beloved and influential Australian releases of its time. To mark its fift
 eenth anniversary\, Adalita reunites with original collaborator JP Shilo t
 o perform the album in full\, revisiting the songs that first began this e
 xtraordinary chapter. Coinciding with the tour\, Adalita will also be reis
 sued on vinyl through Mushroom Music\, bringing a long out-of-print favour
 ite back to fans fifteen years on. Don’t miss these special shows. Suppo
 rted by JP Shilo and more. WILL SELL OUT / GET IN EARLY! Doors at 7pm. El 
 Ranchero back deck/bar and Spanish Girl Food Co will be open from 6pm for 
 preshow dinner and drinks. ADALITA Mo's Desert Clubhouse (GOLD COAST) Thur
 sday 24 September 2026 // 7pm doors $40+BF online GA or $50 door if still 
 available // 18+ Mo's is Burleigh Heads' most loved music venue\, licensed
  bars\, creative studios and cultural hub. The Warehouse & El Ranchero bot
 h boast epic bar menus\, cocktails and craft beers. Mo's is a fully licens
 ed venue\, all guests are required to show ID on entry. Tickets will only 
 be refunded through event cancellation or production of a medical certific
 ate within 24hrs of show doors.
LOCATION:Mo's Desert Clubhouse
URL:https://tickets.oztix.com.au/outlet/event/87e616a3-49f2-4b59-9467-488bb
 d20d580
