SUMMARY:Fingal Head Learn-to-Surf Day Trip from the Gold Coast or Byron Bay
DESCRIPTION:📱 Smartphone tickets ⚡ Instant access to your tickets Ride
  the waves at Fingal Head on a full-day surf adventure! Just a short hop s
 outh from the Gold Coast\, this stunning spot offers perfect breaks for le
 arning to surf. Enjoy back-to-back 90-minute lessons\, feast on lunch and 
 snacks\, and get a chance to see whales and dolphins on a lighthouse tour.
  Plus\, master the art of boomerang throwing and take home a pro photo pac
 kage to remember the day. Get your tickets for Fingal Head Learn-to-Surf D
 ay Trip from the Gold Coast or Byron Bay! Highlights 🏄‍♂️ Master 
 surfing with two 90-minute lessons at scenic Fingal Head. 🐋 Spot whales
  and dolphins on a lighthouse tour. 🪃 Learn the art of boomerang throwi
 ng. What's included? ✔️ All surfing equipment provided for an unparall
 eled experience. ✔️ FREE photo package to capture your thrilling momen
 ts. ✔️ 100% stand-up guarantee\, ensuring you ride the waves with conf
 idence. ✔️ Delicious lunch included to refuel your adventures. ✔️ 
 Comfortable transport by air-conditioned minivan for a hassle-free journey
 . ✔️ Two 1.5-hour surf lessons\, tailored to elevate your skills. Addi
 tional Information 👶 Infants can ride in a pram or need to sit on an ad
 ult's lap. 🐕 Service animals are welcome. 🚆 Public transportation op
 tions are available nearby. 🏋️‍♂️ A moderate level of physical 
 fitness is required. 🩳 Bring swimming gear\, beach towel\, sunscreen\, 
 and a sun hat. 👧 Children under 12 must be accompanied by an adult. �
 � Please inform us of any specific dietary requirements at the time of b
 ooking. Why choose Fever? ✔️ Millions of users book every month. ✔
 ️ The best prices and availability at all times. ✔️ Thousands of uni
 que experiences. ✔️ Verified user reviews. ✔️ 24/7 customer servic
 e. Experience available in the following language(s): Spanish\, English\, 
 Japanese\, French Experience supplied by: Australian Surfing Adventures Al
 l ticket sales are final and cannot be refunded\, exchanged\, or otherwise
  modified. Click here to check out the T&Cs .
LOCATION:Fever Gold Coast
URL:https://feverup.com/m/167346
END:VEVENT
