SUMMARY:Spirit of Gold Coast Whale Watching
DESCRIPTION:Tickets 🎫 Adult ticket for 1 person (15 - 60) Each ticket in
 cludes Whale Photographic Booklet gift Coffee and/or Tea Live commentary o
 n board Professional guide Free parking at Mariner's Cove Marina General I
 nfo 📅 Dates: various dates available 🕒 Time: 9:30 a.m. – 12 p.m. 
 📍 Venue: 60 - 70 Seaworld DR 👤 Age requirement: 15+ Description Get 
 excited and be amazed on this 2.5 hour Gold Coast Whale Watching tour. Wit
 ness the beauty of the Humpback Whales as they migrate past the Gold Coast
  from June to November. This family-owned and operated business with over 
 20 years whale watching experience is committed to offering you the best c
 ustomer service and memories to last a lifetime. With caring and knowledge
 able crew who are focused on your comfort and safety as well as guaranteed
  whale sightings\, you can travel with peace of mind. Terms and conditions
 : For a full refund\, cancel at least 24 hours in advance of the start dat
 e of the experience.
