SUMMARY:Movie Mornings at Currumbin RSL
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our FREE Monthly Movie Mornings at Currumbin RSL. E
 ach month a new movie is selected and screened upstairs in our Waterside F
 unction space. Limited spots are available and registration is required fo
 r this event via the website or contact reception – 55347999 September M
 ovie: The Sheep Detectives When a shepherd who reads murder mysteries to h
 is flock every night turns up dead\, his sheep are convinced its murder an
 d set out to crack the case themselves. Starring Hugh Jackman\, this cleve
 r whodunit proves that sometimes the best detectives have four legs and pl
 enty of wool. Tea\, coffee station available.
LOCATION:165 Duringan St\, Currumbin QLD 4223\, Australia
