SUMMARY:Currumbin Wildlife Sanctuary General Entry Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Tickets 🎫 General entry ticket for 1 person to the Currumbin
  Wildlife Sanctuary Highlights 🐨 Experience Australia's amazing native 
 wildlife 🌴 Wander through the lush surroundings of Currumbin Wildlife S
 anctuary’s natural coastal rainforest 🐒 Immerse yourself in the new L
 ost Valley 🦜 Enjoy the exciting and interactive displays and presentati
 ons General Info 📅 Date: various dates (select during purchase) 🕒 Ho
 urs: 9 a.m. to 4 p.m. ⏳ Duration: 2 to 6 hours approx. 📍 Location: Cu
 rrumbin Wildlife Sanctuary\, Gold Coast Hwy ♿ Accessibility: there is no
  problem getting around on wheelchairs. However\, the assistance of a care
 r will be needed on some of the steep walks. The venue is stroller accessi
 ble ❓ Please note: social distancing will be enforced throughout the exp
 erience\, and hand sanitizer will be available ❗ For this event\, all sa
 les are final and tickets can’t be refunded\, changed or modified. For m
 ore information\, please refer to our T&Cs Description Spend a day at Curr
 umbin Wildlife Sanctuary\, home to the world's largest collection of Austr
 alian native animals. With hundreds of native Australian animals on displa
 y in natural bushland and rainforest settings\, Currumbin Wildlife Sanctua
 ry provides a rare opportunity to see and experience Australia's amazing n
 ative wildlife. Watch some amazing animal feeding shows with lorikeets\, p
 elicans\, eels\, kangaroos\, crocodiles and many more animals\, or attend 
 the fascinating Wild Skies Free Flight bird show. You'll also be able to e
 xperience an Aboriginal dance performance\, and spend some time immersed i
 n an environment that existed millions of years ago at the Lost Valley. Th
 ere is so much to see and do!
LOCATION:Currumbin Wildlife Sanctuary
URL:https://feverup.com/m/93868
END:VEVENT
