BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-qlhk44@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260925T183000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260925T220000
SUMMARY:Roaring Lion (Bob Marley Tribute)
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a proper Bob Marley celebration with Roaring Lion
 \, Queensland’s powerhouse 8-piece tribute band bringing the sounds of "
 The Legend" to life. Expect all the classics - Exodus\, Could You Be Loved
 \, Buffalo Soldier\, Three Little Birds\, One Love - the kind of set that 
 gets everyone singing\, moving\, and locked in from the first song. Grab y
 our crew and vibe it out. Whether you’re a longtime Marley fan or just w
 ant a solid night with good music and good energy\, this one hits right. R
 oaring Lion is Australia’s premiere Bob Marley tribute band. On stage\, 
 its eight band members present a colourful explosion of the best reggae of
  our times - the beautiful and enduring music of Bob Marley. Formed in 201
 9\, Roaring Lion is based in Queensland and has been performing regularly 
 throughout Queensland. Roaring Lion have also performed in New South Wales
  and Melbourne\, Victoria. Everywhere they play\, their audiences sing and
  dance\, in happy celebration of the man and his message. The musicians in
  Roaring Lion work hard to represent Bob Marley’s music with respect and
  authenticity. The music is classic roots reggae with drum ‘n’ bass\, 
 bubble\, skank\, lead and rhythm guitars. Backing vocalists sing harmonies
  on every song\, while keys play the familiar sounds of clavinet\, Moog\, 
 and Hammond organ\, plus horns and strings. In 2024\, Roaring Lion had the
  honour to open the Queensland premiere for the ‘Bob Marley: One Love’
  movie by Paramount Pictures. The band consistently presents a tight show 
 of the most popular songs\, as well as other well-known and cherished melo
 dies. Roaring Lion continues to grow its repertoire of over sixty songs to
  keep shows fresh and deepen engagement with its loyal followers. Roaring 
 Lion delivers a show for all to remember\, and is consistently invited bac
 k to perform at venues.
LOCATION:Miami Marketta (18+)
URL:https://www.miamimarketta.com/ticketed-events/roaring-lion
END:VEVENT
